        "## 8. Assistant rules\n",
        "\n",
        "The assistant applies emergency escalation first, then unsupported-query detection, then low-confidence handling, and finally intent classification and knowledge retrieval."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 8,
      "id": "8f934c9c",
